{"unit_id":"161bbf221fa06716b7e2","title":"提案三、有關病毒性肝炎檢驗項目審查注意事項之審核共識，提請討論。","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p3-b16","raw_text":"提案三、有關病毒性肝炎檢驗項目審查注意事項之審核共識，提請討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[36.0,584.7696533203125,551.9099731445312,602.4373779296875]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p3-b17","raw_text":"說明: \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,620.7996826171875,76.4939956665039,638.4674072265625]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p3-b18","raw_text":"1. 患者初次主訴B、C 肝炎帶原，可檢驗GOT、GPT、HBsAg (或\n","start_char":0,"end_char":38,"bbox":[57.263999938964844,656.7996826171875,511.55999755859375,674.4674072265625]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p3-b19","raw_text":"Anti-HCV)，即使結果正常，亦不應核刪。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":25,"bbox":[78.38400268554688,692.7996826171875,379.2099914550781,710.4674072265625]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p3-b20","raw_text":"2. B、C 肝炎每6 個月追蹤一次，含GOT、GPT、AFP、ECHO。  高危\n","start_char":0,"end_char":42,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,728.795654296875,558.8400268554688,746.46337890625]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b1","raw_text":"險群每3 個月追蹤一次。(高危險群指肝硬化、肝癌家族史)。肝功能檢\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,44.699623107910156,559.4046630859375,62.36734390258789]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b2","raw_text":"查必要時得包含ALP、 GGT …。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":20,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,80.71964263916016,318.3399963378906,98.38735961914062]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b3","raw_text":"3. B 肝患者，追蹤HBeAg 間隔時間：陽性者得每6-12 月追蹤一次。陰性\n","start_char":0,"end_char":41,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,116.71964263916016,559.3928833007812,134.38735961914062]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b4","raw_text":"者，肝功能突然上升可追加檢驗。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":17,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,152.71963500976562,315.3399963378906,170.38735961914062]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b5","raw_text":"4. B、C 肝炎追蹤試辦計畫之收案規定: 應有HBsAg 與Anti-HCV 報告，\n","start_char":0,"end_char":44,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,188.71963500976562,562.6799926757812,206.38735961914062]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b6","raw_text":"HBsAg 陽性者應再驗HBeAg。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":20,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,224.71963500976562,286.41998291015625,242.38735961914062]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b7","raw_text":"5. HBeAg 陽性患者使用抗病毒製劑治療，使用期限至少3 年。治療期間\n","start_char":0,"end_char":38,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,260.7496032714844,558.2117309570312,278.4173278808594]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b8","raw_text":"陰轉者，自陰轉點起可延長一年治療期，故共治療≧3 年，≦4 年。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,296.7496032714844,547.469970703125,314.4173278808594]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b9","raw_text":"HBeAg 陰性者，可補檢查anti-HBe。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":25,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,332.7496032714844,331.41998291015625,350.4173278808594]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b10","raw_text":"6. B、C 肝治療試辦計畫規定>161 天即可登錄。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":29,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,368.7496032714844,392.8096008300781,386.4173278808594]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b11","raw_text":"決議：通過，同意說明段1~6 點，惟第5 點修正為：HBeAg 陽性患者使用\n","start_char":0,"end_char":39,"bbox":[36.0,404.7496032714844,553.53173828125,422.4173278808594]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b12","raw_text":"抗病毒製劑治療，使用期限 12~36 個月，治療期間即使一年內陰轉也可以\n","start_char":0,"end_char":37,"bbox":[36.0,440.7696228027344,556.5885620117188,458.4373474121094]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b13","raw_text":"使用三年，且自陰轉點起可延長一年治療期，故共治療≧3 年，≦4 年。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":36,"bbox":[36.0,476.7696228027344,544.1099853515625,494.4373474121094]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b14","raw_text":"HBeAg 陰性者，可補檢查anti-HBe。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":25,"bbox":[36.0,512.7696533203125,296.0199890136719,530.4373779296875]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b15","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,549.4896240234375,39.9900016784668,567.1573486328125]},{"page":4,"block_id":"MEET-01344b1cdba06e3007aa-p4-b16","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,585.4896240234375,39.9900016784668,603.1573486328125]}],"source_quality":[]}